number}, val] makes a coil grid with label name, partioned in size rows and \
with label the val at location number.\nMakeCoilLayout[{coils..}] same but \
for multile coils grids. Each coil grid is defined as {name, size, number}.\n\
MakeCoilLayout[{coils..}, val] savem but for multiple coil grids.", 
    "Documentation" -> <|"Local" -> "paclet:QMRITools/ref/MakeCoilLayout"|>, 
