The input data can be in the forms: data, {data, vox}, {data, mask} or {data, \
mask, vox}.\n\nRegisterData[target, moving] registers the moving data to the \
target data. target can be 2D or 3D. moving can be the same of one dimension \
higher than the target.\nThe inputs target and moving can be in the forms: \
data, {data, vox}, {data, mask} or {data, mask, vox}.\n\nOutput is the \
