data using MN/sigma where the mean signal MN is the average voxel\nvalue over \
all dynamics N and the sigma is the standard deviation over all dynamics N.", 
    "Documentation" -> <|"Local" -> "paclet:QMRITools/ref/SNRMapCalc"|>, 
