    "EPGT2Fit[data, {nEcho, detlaTE}, {exitation, refoucs}] fits the t2 based \
on Marty B et.al. Simultaneous muscle water t2 and fat fraction mapping using \
transverse relaxometry with stimulated echo compensation.\nExitation and \
refocus are the RF pulse angles e.g. 90,180. They can also be a range of \
angeles over the slice profile as defined by GetSliceProfile.\n\nThe output \
is in units as defined by the detlaTE, e.g. if detlaTE is in ms the output is \
in ms.\nThe exitation and refocus are defined in Degrees.\n\nOutput is \
{{{T2map,B1Map},{wat, fat, fatMap}, residual},callibration} or \
{{T2map,B1Map},{wat, fat, fatMap}, residual}.\n\nEPGT2Fit[] is based on DOI: \
10.1002/nbm.3459.", 
    "Documentation" -> <|"Local" -> "paclet:QMRITools/ref/EPGT2Fit"|>, 
    "OwnValues" -> None, "UpValues" -> None, "DownValues" -> None, 
    "SubValues" -> None, "DefaultValues" -> 
    Information`InformationValueForm[
     DefaultValues, QMRITools`RelaxometryTools`EPGT2Fit, {
      SyntaxInformation[QMRITools`RelaxometryTools`EPGT2Fit] -> {
        "ArgumentsPattern" -> {
           Blank[], 
           Blank[], 
           Blank[], 
           OptionsPattern[]}}}], "NValues" -> None, "FormatValues" -> None, 
    "Options" -> {
     QMRITools`RelaxometryTools`EPGRelaxPars -> {1400., 365.}, 
      QMRITools`RelaxometryTools`DictB1Range -> {0.5, 1.4, 0.02}, 
      QMRITools`RelaxometryTools`DictT2Range -> {15., 45., 0.2}, 
      QMRITools`RelaxometryTools`EPGFitFat -> True, 
      QMRITools`RelaxometryTools`EPGCalibrate -> False, 
      QMRITools`RelaxometryTools`DictT2fRange -> {120, 190., 2.5}, 
      QMRITools`RelaxometryTools`DictT2fValue -> 150., 
      QMRITools`RelaxometryTools`EPGFitPoints -> 50, 
      QMRITools`RelaxometryTools`EPGMethod -> "dictionary", 
      QMRITools`GeneralTools`MonitorCalc -> True, 
      QMRITools`RelaxometryTools`OutputCalibration -> False, 
      QMRITools`RelaxometryTools`EPGSmoothB1 -> True, 
      QMRITools`RelaxometryTools`WaterFatShift -> 0., 
      QMRITools`RelaxometryTools`WaterFatShiftDirection -> "left", 
      QMRITools`RelaxometryTools`EPGFatShift -> 0., 
      QMRITools`RelaxometryTools`DictT2IncludeWater -> False, 
      QMRITools`RelaxometryTools`EPGMethodCal -> "2comp"}, 
    "Attributes" -> {Protected, ReadProtected}, "FullName" -> 
    "QMRITools`RelaxometryTools`EPGT2Fit"|>, True]]], "Print",
