aligns the spectra with the given peak positions peaks wich is a list of ppm \
values. \nFindSpectraPpmShift[spectra, {dw, gyro}, {peaks, amps}] finds the \
ppm value that aligns the spectra with the given peak positions peaks wich is \
a list of ppm values and amps are ther relative amplitudes. \n\
FindSpectraPpmShift[spectra, {dw, gyro}, specTar] finds the ppm value that \
aligns the spectra with the given target spectra specTar.", 
